metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 144: the Electrokoopa on the net (AmiNoko), Pinna Park's crackling Koopa. Put it ON a net, a wall, a ceiling or a floor (within 0.4 m) and give it a Graph: a Node3D child whose children are the points of its path, placed on the same surface -- it crawls from point to point (a random other one each time), stops and turns at each. Its body and the charged air 1.3 m out from its back shock Mario on the same side (the shock pose, -1 HP); it then sits stunned a few seconds. To kill one on a net: climb the OTHER side and punch it (B) -- it flies off its back and vanishes in a puff. A ground pound kills one on a floor. The hose stuns it. Jumping on it only bounces you. For Mario to climb the net its StaticBody3D needs metadata sms_fence (any value) or the group sms_fence. Knobs: Deviations (SpeedScale, ClipSet, FeetOnPlane, AttacksAcrossTheNet), Effects (the sparks, the stun stars, the smoke, the wall puff), Sounds (five slots); RelaunchTicks -1 = gone for good (1800 = back in 15 s)."

